  "cost": 0,
  "interpretation": "<ul data-start=\"2127\" data-end=\"2422\">\n<li data-start=\"2127\" data-end=\"2231\">\n<p data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2231\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2129\" data-end=\"2144\">Normal EEG:</strong> Symmetrical background activity, appropriate reactivity, no epileptiform discharges.</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2232\" data-end=\"2330\">\n<p data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2330\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2234\" data-end=\"2251\">Abnormal EEG:</strong> Slowing, focal changes, or epileptiform discharges (localization specified).</span></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-size: 10px;\" data-start=\"2331\" data-end=\"2422\">\n<p data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2422\"><span style=\"font-size: 10px;\"><strong data-start=\"2333\" data-end=\"2367\">Clinical Correlation Required:</strong> Must be interpreted with clinical context and imaging.</span></p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
